      "object_role": "synthesis",
      "proposed_content": "The paper specializes an imported Ramachandra estimate and applies Holder's inequality to obtain Lemma 11, propagates that control across the required discs through Lemmas 12-14 using maximum modulus, and combines Lemma 14 with the lower-moment fact from Theorem 3(i) for Theorem 4(i). For Theorem 4(ii), the proof switches under the prime-modulus hypothesis to the stronger separately imported Lemmas 15-16 rather than merely reusing the same chain.",
